//! Interactive Clifford-Bezier patch with an honest perspective camera.
//!
//! The surface is Krasauskas, Zube, and Cacciola's bilinear isotropic
//! Clifford-Bezier cyclide. Fe owns the orbit camera, point manipulation,
//! independent rational corner weights, depth palette, and analytic wire
//! coverage. The fixed browser host transports events and realizes WebGPU.
//!
//! Wire antialiasing is geometric rather than sampled: the vertex shader
//! projects the local surface differential and emits the opposite-edge
//! altitude of each dyadic microtriangle in physical pixels. Perspective
//! interpolation reconstructs screen-space edge distance in the fragment
//! shader, where one smooth coverage ramp supplies a constant-pixel feather.

